# What stays out of the Knowledge Vault.
#
# Same syntax as .gitignore: a directory (docs/_archive/), a glob
# (*.generated.md), `!` to re-include, last matching rule wins.
# Paths are relative to the project root. Applies both to live watching
# and to imports (ai-kit watch add / add-doc).
#
# Typical entries on an inherited codebase:
#   docs/_archive/        someone else's archived documentation
#   docs/**/plans/        execution plans — a record of the past, not knowledge
#   **/node_modules/      vendored trees
